Subtask 2.4: Configure Vault to Use Consul for Service Discovery
Update Vault configuration to include service registration:

sudo tee /etc/vault.d/vault.hcl > /dev/null <<EOF
storage "consul" {
  address = "127.0.0.1:8500"
  path    = "vault/"
}

listener "tcp" {
  address     = "127.0.0.1:8200"
  tls_disable = 1
}

