EOF
Restart Vault to apply the new configuration:

sudo systemctl restart vault

# Wait for Vault to start
sleep 10

# Unseal Vault again
vault operator unseal $UNSEAL_KEY_1
vault operator unseal $UNSEAL_KEY_2
vault operator unseal $UNSEAL_KEY_3

# Verify service registration
consul catalog services
Subtask 2.5: Test Service Discovery Integration
Create a simple script to demonstrate service discovery:

tee ~/service-discovery-test.sh > /dev/null <<'EOF'
